イラストをお願いしたくて是非依頼して頂ければと思います！！\n\n【リクエスト】\n愛羽あうのSDイラスト\nお祝いのイラストとして使いたいのでいぬっこまる様の描く世界観を存分に出して頂きたいです！\n\n愛羽あうXリンク先（ https://x.com/aiuau_wonbat?t=K1zkP2HoZ3ClSQrl0YVxSw&s=09 ）\nキャラクターの見た目は参照URLにてお願いします。\n\n背景・ポーズ、イラスト構成はお任せします。\n\n要素としては見た目だけは清楚なのにとにかく元気さが伝わるようなイラストをお願いしたいです。\n配信者の要素としてはゲラ元気音量注意、とにかくよく食べるが基本なので参考にして頂けるとうれしいです。\n\n【使用用途】\n配信活動に伴う商用利用含む全般\n配信に使うサムネイル\nXの画像投稿\n返礼品での使用\nなど\n\n【その他】\nミニキャラ、背景でレイヤーを分けたデータを頂けるとうれしいです。\n\n\nお値段変更や内容など厳しい部分ありましたらキャンセルや再送要請して下さい…！！お忙しいとは思いますが、ご検討の程よろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1flRUAgcp6Py4coSIrzxxslvPkqFscysy/view?usp=drivesdk", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@inukkomaru/works/94", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5a7d07cf/uploads/origins/e0bca9a8-2997-4670-b36c-3071f6f864a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eeef835cb66e0e82fc05bcc2cb899075", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5a7d07cf/uploads/origins/e0bca9a8-2997-4670-b36c-3071f6f864a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eeef835cb66e0e82fc05bcc2cb899075, https://si.imgix.net/5a7d07cf/uploads/origins/e0bca9a8-2997-4670-b36c-3071f6f864a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8a40628e2d69a9c824792a0e03553052 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5a7d07cf/uploads/origins/e0bca9a8-2997-4670-b36c-3071f6f864a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=93bf25075856b8720a080b1e1050c648 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "いぬっこまる様はじめまして\nいつも素敵なイラスト拝見しています\n\n今回は私のOCのれいりをお願いしたいです\n性格は、少し生意気な女の子です\n左側の下まつげ、右側の上まつげが特徴的です\n瞳孔は白いです\n\n参考資料ですhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1n8Kd-rjC0qtRhFpcbhh2YS7YA6Z5F0TO\n\n使用用途\n･SNSアイコン\n･個人使用目的のグッズ制作(アクリルキーホルダー等)\n\n慣れないリクエストで至らない点があるかもしれませんが\nご検討の程よろしくお願い致します\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1n8Kd-rjC0qtRhFpcbhh2YS7YA6Z5F0TO", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@inukkomaru/works/93", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6a32ee42/uploads/origins/d87a0344-61f9-4f8a-b27e-c081de20af58?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6b12ebd35ea50112538768a96fe6c519", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6a32ee42/uploads/origins/d87a0344-61f9-4f8a-b27e-c081de20af58?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6b12ebd35ea50112538768a96fe6c519, https://si.imgix.net/6a32ee42/uploads/origins/d87a0344-61f9-4f8a-b27e-c081de20af58?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e2b9f511052c6b5952f50f425f940caa 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6a32ee42/uploads/origins/d87a0344-61f9-4f8a-b27e-c081de20af58?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=58baaf5f68d3ad91fe0b87e8dc88cc38 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Thank you again for the previous illustration! This time, I'd like to request an illustration of the VTuber (Gloomi). Please depict her holding her mascot character. Place beer and a pack of cigarettes in the background. Feel free to handle other details as you see fit. I plan to use this artwork as a gift for (Gloomi) on social media and during streams.\nhttps://imgur.com/a/tRFrLSO\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/tRFrLSO", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@inukkomaru/works/92", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/19debd2f/uploads/origins/b32d0928-e587-4693-b6f4-dfb6f45bbf3b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4860ab94cfb52e2c3249dc9db50bc4d3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/19debd2f/uploads/origins/b32d0928-e587-4693-b6f4-dfb6f45bbf3b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4860ab94cfb52e2c3249dc9db50bc4d3, https://si.imgix.net/19debd2f/uploads/origins/b32d0928-e587-4693-b6f4-dfb6f45bbf3b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a92d9c4ecef4861033e5b0a4ea987d42 2x, https://si.imgix.net/19debd2f/uploads/origins/b32d0928-e587-4693-b6f4-dfb6f45bbf3b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=94256dfbcd9dfda3d5c6db8d5cdef7ae 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "It's wonderful to see you again. I was extremely satisfied with the work I commissioned last time, so I'd like to request a similar piece this time. Please create an illustration of VTuber Misha Pyon. She is a rabbit biologist who absolutely loves beer. Please be sure to include beer and a test tubes; feel free to choose the pose and expression. This illustration will be used as a gift for Misha on social media and livestreams.\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/bEVtVFm\nhttps://imgur.com/a/8hoEzmu", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@inukkomaru/works/91", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/fa51f800/uploads/origins/3116fd9e-b454-410a-87ca-44fd2d175f49?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b039f0ad66811265cc9148377c7afda8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fa51f800/uploads/origins/3116fd9e-b454-410a-87ca-44fd2d175f49?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b039f0ad66811265cc9148377c7afda8, https://si.imgix.net/fa51f800/uploads/origins/3116fd9e-b454-410a-87ca-44fd2d175f49?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=50f1e06dfb458cf92f0d119076329970 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fa51f800/uploads/origins/3116fd9e-b454-410a-87ca-44fd2d175f49?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=05837768f1809d7ec8b487b115e70122 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at